### 1. Login as Admin
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.token); %}

### 2. Login as Security
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "security1",
  "password": "password123"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.token); %}

### 3. Get All Parking Slots
GET http://localhost:8080/api/parking-slots
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Normal Path: Log Vehicle Entry (Parks in Slot 5)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/visitors
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "vehicleNumber": "TN38AB1234",
  "flatId": 1,
  "slotId": 5
}

### 5. Business Rule 1: Attempt Duplicate Slot 5 (Expects 409 Conflict)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/visitors
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "vehicleNumber": "TN40CD5678",
  "flatId": 2,
  "slotId": 5
}

### 6. View Currently Occupied Slots
GET http://localhost:8080/api/parking-slots/occupied
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Mark Vehicle Exit (Frees Slot 5)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/visitors/1/exit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Business Rule 3: Attempt Exit Twice (Expects 400 Bad Request)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/visitors/1/exit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Daily Visitor Report
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reports/daily
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
